DMA stream x peripheral address register: DMAx_Streamy->PAR
	Base address of the peripheral data register from/to which the data are read/written

DMA stream x memory 0 address register: DMAx_Streamy->M0AR
	Base address of Memory area 0 from/to which the data are read/writted
DMA stream x memory 1 aaddress register: DMAx_Streamy->M1AR
	Contains the address of a second memory buffer
	Only used when double-buffer mode is enabled

DMA stream x number of data register: DMAx_Streamy->NDTR
	Number of data items to be transferred (0 up to 65535)
